units in
template plain_b.ps
field Title PLATE WITH A FLANGE
material ALUMINUM SHEET, %%t THICK.
finish NONE.
note THE ROUND OPENINGS ARE HOLES; THE SQUARE ONES AND THE NOTCH ARE CUTS.
note THE SIZE OF THE NOTCH IS GIVEN ACROSS ITS INSIDE, FROM EDGE TO EDGE.
view front scale 2
 lin x 2.756in 3.543in
